              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "products"]
            },
            "description": "Admin only. Creates a product and saves `id` to `productId`.\n\n### Fields\n- `name`: required, 3–100 characters.\n- `description`: optional, max 2000 characters.\n- `priceInMinorUnits`: required, integer greater than zero. Example: `125075` means `1250.75` in the currency.\n- `stock`: required, integer starting from zero.\n- `categoryId`: required, ID of an existing category.\n- `image`: optional.\n- `isActive`: optional, default `true`.\n\n### Server-owned fields\n- `slug`\n- `ratingAverage`: starts at zero.\n- `ratingsCount`: starts at zero."
          },
          "response": []
