            "description": "Creates a shipping address and saves `id` to `addressId`.\n\nThe first address becomes default even if `isDefault` is omitted.\n\nPhone must be Saudi: `05XXXXXXXX` or `+9665XXXXXXXX`.\n`country` is stored as `SA` and should not be sent.\nMaximum 10 addresses per user."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Address By Id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
